
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LibTrack - Library Management System</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">
            <h2>LibTrack</h2>
        </div>

        <nav>
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="#features">Features</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="/login">Login</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="home">
            <h1>Welcome to LibTrack</h1>
            <h2>Your Library Management System</h2>
            <p>
                Manage library resources, explore books, and
                organize borrowing and returning transactions
                with LibTrack.
            </p>
            <a href="/books">Explore Books</a>
            <a href="/login">Get Started</a>
        </section>

        <section id="features">
            <h2>Our Features</h2>

            <div class="features-container">

                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Book Catalog</h3>
                    <p>Browse and search available library books.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Book Management</h3>
                    <p>Organize and manage book information.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Borrowing and Returning</h3>
                    <p>Manage book borrowing and return transactions.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Transaction Records</h3>
                    <p>Keep track of library activities and records.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="about">
            <h2>About LibTrack</h2>
            <p>
                LibTrack is a library management system designed
                to help organize library collections, manage
                borrowing transactions, and improve access to
                library resources.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section id="get-started">
            <h2>Start Exploring LibTrack</h2>
            <p>Access your library resources in one place.</p>
            <a href="/login">Login to Continue</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>
            2026 LibTrack. All rights reserved.
        </p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
